'''ZETA DIVISION''' (formerly known as '''JUPITER'''.) is a [[:Category:Japan|Japanese]] esports organisation. They also feature players and teams in ''[[:brawlstars:ZETA DIVISION ZERO|Brawl Stars]]'', ''[[smash:ZETA DIVISION|Super Smash Bros. Ultimate]]'', ''[[overwatch:ZETA DIVISION|Overwatch]]'', ''[[fortnite:ZETA DIVISION|Fortnite]]'' and ''[[pubgmobile:ZETA DIVISION|PUBG Mobile]]''.

==History==
'''ZETA DIVISION''', formerly known as '''JUPITER''', entered ''VALORANT'' in April 2020.
They have become one of the most successful teams in Japan since the early days of the game, winning the Japanese [[Ignition Series]] and [[First_Strike/Japan|First Strike Japan]].
